guarantee: AC-3: segment time = offset + chunk start + engine time; never before the chunk start
file: crates/voicen-core/src/call/transcript.rs
added_by: test-writer
--- old
chunk_start
                    .saturating_add(engine_ms(seconds))
                    .min(chunk_end)
--- new
